    "steam_appid": 2673260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673260/extras/83e4409b1140eece1a98f33ff83b9a4c.avif?t=1711776018\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Colonel Arthur McDouglas was finally enjoying some off time after retiring from the United States military.  Suddenly he hears a message on the radio from the president of the United States that says the country is being attacked by an alien invasion force. So the Colonel grabs his rifle and a few energy bars to take on alien invasion force himself.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673260/extras/87f5702b3fca98c3e2c4f115ed41f0a6.avif?t=1711776018\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Run and gun while you shoot down hoards of alien space ships in a bullet hell shooter/endless runner. Upgrade your gun with various power ups and weapon types like rockets, grenades and lasers. And finally defeat menacing boss ships to save the world from the scourge of alien invaders.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673260/extras/aa5cad1fe1fcb64d79c73a14523f1d84.avif?t=1711776018\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Campaign Mode<br>Run and shoot though each level till you beat the boss at the end.<br><br><br>Endless Mode<br>The difficulty of the level keeps increasing with every wave of enemy ships so you can rack up the highest score possible.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673260/extras/2d736715a2e9098b8ee4526274eb3cc9.avif?t=1711776018\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>* 8 Levels<br>* Epic boss battles<br>* Multiple Weapon Types<br>* Power ups to increase weapon shot count and spread",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673260/extras/83e4409b1140eece1a98f33ff83b9a4c.avif?t=1711776018\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Colonel Arthur McDouglas was finally enjoying some off time after retiring from the United States military.  Suddenly he hears a message on the radio from the president of the United States that says the country is being attacked by an alien invasion force. So the Colonel grabs his rifle and a few energy bars to take on alien invasion force himself.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673260/extras/87f5702b3fca98c3e2c4f115ed41f0a6.avif?t=1711776018\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Run and gun while you shoot down hoards of alien space ships in a bullet hell shooter/endless runner. Upgrade your gun with various power ups and weapon types like rockets, grenades and lasers. And finally defeat menacing boss ships to save the world from the scourge of alien invaders.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673260/extras/aa5cad1fe1fcb64d79c73a14523f1d84.avif?t=1711776018\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Campaign Mode<br>Run and shoot though each level till you beat the boss at the end.<br><br><br>Endless Mode<br>The difficulty of the level keeps increasing with every wave of enemy ships so you can rack up the highest score possible.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673260/extras/2d736715a2e9098b8ee4526274eb3cc9.avif?t=1711776018\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>* 8 Levels<br>* Epic boss battles<br>* Multiple Weapon Types<br>* Power ups to increase weapon shot count and spread",
